== Trivia ==
* It is the posthumous version of Pin.
* The definition of the word frail is weak and delicate, which explains its rotting body and depressed look in The Frail's first phase.
* The main body of The Frail's battle sprite is heavily based on {{e|Larry Jr.}}'s battle sprite.
* {{dlc|a+}} The Frail can be found in {{s|The Void}}, even before being unlocked.
* The name is possibly a reference to [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rOMcxTK7-0w the Nine Inch Nails song of the same name].
* It is the boss version of the {{e|Pasty|text=Pasties}}.
** Even if it is the boss version of Pasties, it precedes their addition.

